contentText:
The Backstreet Boys have soundtracked a lot of formative memories for fans over the years &#8212; including Drake . In a video interview with Billboard that went live Wednesday (June 24), the members of the boy band recalled the special moment they shared with Drizzy a few years ago in Toronto, which apparently included the rapper revealing his first kiss had been to one of their songs.

